{"codec":"JSON-syntax-dictionary-v4","atoms":["\"issuer\"","\"cutoff\"","\"framework\"","\"scores\"","\"factor_evidence\"","\"score_sensitivity\"","\"gates\"","\"history\"","\"metrics\"","\"liquidity\"","\"audit_evidence\"","\"source_register\"","\"model\"","\"classification\"","\"assumptions\"","\"legal_name\"","\"symbol\"","\"isin\"","\"exchange\"","\"cin\"","\"issued_shares\"","\"R.K. Fashion Accessories Limited\"","\"RKFAL\"","\"INE2O2Y01016\"","\"NSE Emerge SME\"","\"U18109WB2010PLC144256\"","15516763","\"information\"","\"market\"","\"price\"","\"no_hindsight\"","\"2026-10-20 Asia/Kolkata\"","\"2026-10-19 close\"","\"68.60\"","true","\"name\"","\"sha256\"","\"version\"","\"dated\"","\"factors\"","\"sections\"","\"rounding\"","\"Small-Micro-Cap-Stock-Research-Master-Prompt-v3.0\"","\"68d4de4255427df276318d0231530b867a453e740c74150e9768bf1387224137\"","\"3.0\"","\"2026-10-03\"","13","4","15","\"Decimal ROUND_HALF_UP; no NS redistribution\"","\"BQS\"","\"GQS\"","\"IAS\"","\"terms\"","\"known_contribution\"","\"missing_weight\"","\"coverage\"","\"raw\"","\"raw_bound\"","\"cap\"","\"final\"","\"effective_bound\"","\"display\"","\"rank_eligible\"","\"factor\"","\"weight\"","\"score\"","\"contribution\"","\"GOV\"","\"0.20\"","\"0.80\"","\"MOAT\"","\"REV\"","\"0.12\"","null","\"DUR\"","\"0.10\"","5","\"0.50\"","\"CAP\"","\"CASH\"","2","\"BAL\"","\"0.08\"","\"EXEC\"","\"0.40\"","\"2.70\"","\"0.32\"","\"0.68\"","\"3.02\"","\"5.90\"","\"NS\"","false","\"1.00\"","\"EARN\"","\"0.15\"","\"0.60\"","\"1.80\"","\"0.55\"","\"0.45\"","\"2.35\"","\"7.30\"","\"5\"","\"0.25\"","\"R\"","\"0.35\"","\"D\"","3","\"P\"","\"0.30\"","\"L\"","\"0.90\"","\"0.70\"","\"1.60\"","\"7.90\"","\"code\"","\"confidence\"","\"support\"","\"contrary\"","\"Medium\"","\"No OFS; IPO all primary capital and no pledge/convertibles in 9 Oct shareholding [S2].\"","\"Family-related funding and transactions are disclosed; no auditor change in preceding 3 years [S1 p 88].\"","\"Contrary: noncash financing and related balances conflict; newly constituted independent oversight has no long listed record [A02,A03,A05].\"","\"Regional wholesale relationships and branded design/quality coordination exist [S1 pp 197-227].\"","\"Top 10 FY26 customers 15.15%; no exclusive Karigar/noncompete and no committed order book [S1 pp 40-49].\"","\"Contrary: 12-15% pricing action and strong jewellery revenue growth show some commercial franchise; durable excess returns and switching costs are unverified.\"","\"Low\"","\"Reported FY24-FY26 revenue rose 1328.49→3035.71 lakh, only 2 annual intervals [S1 p 291].\"","\"FY24 merger, FY25 packaging takeovers and Aug 25 price rise obscure organic same-perimeter demand [A03;S1 p 339].\"","\"No reliable 3/5 year organic CAGR, volumes, same-store sales or acquired contribution; do not award 9 from nominal 2 year CAGR.\"","\"Additional B2B showroom and B2C floors provide concrete distribution avenues; plating design 8064 kg/year [S1 pp 145-157].\"","\"West Bengal 65.77% and eastern states 86.32% FY26; no orders or independent plant appraisal [S1 pp 39-49,131].\"","\"Contrary: affordable imitation can substitute expensive gold, but accessible share/units and showroom mature cohorts are ND.\"","\"Incremental finance-side capital proxy and normalized operating earnings can be calculated [S1 pp 290-303].\"","\"Property investment, acquired businesses and proposed 8.8037 crore plating facility do not provide matched project returns [A02,A03,S1 p 145].\"","\"Accounting-return proxy is not a verified incremental cohort ROIC; cost per kg, volumes, mix, unit contribution and sustainable maintenance capex missing.\"","\"Three audited/restated annual CFO sums negative 90.79 lakh against PAT 923.19 lakh [S1 p 292].\"","\"Receivable ageing and inventory cycle worsen into June; supplier credit no longer offsets growth [A04].\"","\"Contrary: showroom stocking has a stated commercial reason and IPO funds it, but negative conversion persists over 3 years; not merely one transient quarter.\"","\"June cash 0.2495 crore vs promoter loan 3.064 crore; no bank line [S1 pp 300,353].\"","\"IPO gross 34.99104 crore verified from shares and issue price; objects absorb 27.4681 crore before issue costs/general purposes [S2,S1 pp 129-130].\"","\"Current post-IPO bank balance, exact net proceeds, deployment and promoter loan due dates are not verified; projections are not funding commitments.\"","\"B2C ground floor opened April 2026 and existing B2B extended;37 new customers reported FY26 [S1 pp 133,334].\"","\"IPO completed 12 Oct and expansion has dated civil/retail schedule [S2,S1 pp 149-156].\"","\"Contrary: plant approvals/machine orders and showroom definitive acquisition pending at RHP date; no long promises-vs-delivery record.\"","\"Core operating EBIT improved from loss FY24 to profit FY25/FY26 [S1 p 291].\"","\"FY26 other income 1.1846 crore includes 1.1795 crore investment gain; FY24 similarly gain-dependent [S1 p 301].\"","\"Contrary: FY26 normalized operating profit remains positive, but price/mix/margins changed and post-IPO shares dilute historical EPS; June cannot be annualized.\"","\"Complete monthly conditional model includes capital requirements and funded/unfunded branches.\"","\"Actual entry cash and final net proceeds are not known; conditional returns are not supported forecasts.\"","\"No favorable return score may be assigned by replacing unknown capital position with optional finance.\"","\"Linked bear combines weaker sales/margins, aged collections, opening inventory and delayed overbudget plant.\"","\"Cash-floor breach can precede annual profit recognition; bounded optional equity can run out.\"","\"Contrary: fresh IPO capital and tangible property give potential protection, but restricted uses and illiquid assets do not guarantee recovery.\"","\"Current price 68.60 implies marketcap 106.44499 crore; normalized earnings multiple exceeds reported multiple.\"","\"Reverse/hurdle solutions demand stronger realization or terminal economics than conservative cash-linked base.\"","\"Contrary: a high-execution branch can create value, but not enough evidence for an expectation score above mixed.\"","\"Only 6 possible exchange sessions since 12 Oct; actual issuer rows only 12,13,19 Oct [S3].\"","\"19 Oct turnover 109760 rupees and 1600 shares; stock ST trade-for-trade and 1600 lot [S2-S4].\"","\"20/60 session means, median including verified zero days, spread and executable depth unavailable; pre-listing dates are NA, absent rows ND.\"","\"changed_factor\"","\"delta\"","\"hypothetical_only\"","\"governance_override\"","-1","\"2.50\"","\"2.82\"","\"5.70\"","\"3\"","1","\"2.90\"","\"3.22\"","\"6.10\"","\"gate\"","\"status\"","\"reason\"","\"G1\"","\"Conditional\"","\"No substantiated diversion or minority abuse found; RPT, governance history and financial inconsistencies require reconciliation.\"","\"G2\"","\"Hold — unresolved\"","\"Original statutory/CARO/IFC unavailable, noncash merger and takeover lines in cash flow, conflicting merger/counterparty numbers; no reliable current investment conclusion.\"","\"G3\"","\"Actual entry cash/net proceeds/deployment/promoter-loan terms unverified. Conditional stress cash shortfall is not evidence of actual default.\"","\"G4\"","\"Six possible listed sessions and only three trade rows; 20/60-day implementation test unavailable, ST and 1,600-lot restrictions.\"","\"revenue\"","\"other_income\"","\"material\"","\"traded_purchases\"","\"inventory_expense_change\"","\"employees\"","\"finance\"","\"da\"","\"other_expense\"","\"pbt\"","\"current_tax\"","\"deferred_tax\"","\"pat\"","\"cfo\"","\"cfi\"","\"cff\"","\"cash_capex\"","\"property_purchase_net_investment\"","\"debt\"","\"cash\"","\"equity\"","\"ppe\"","\"investment_property\"","\"financial_investments\"","\"ar\"","\"inventory\"","\"ap\"","\"other_cl\"","\"tax_provision\"","\"short_advances\"","\"other_nca\"","\"jewellery\"","\"cosmetics\"","\"hotel\"","\"jewellery_result\"","\"cosmetics_result\"