ic\"","\"HghPric\"","\"LwPric\"","\"ClsPric\"","\"LastPric\"","\"PrvsClsgPric\"","\"UndrlygPric\"","\"SttlmPric\"","\"OpnIntrst\"","\"ChngInOpnIntrst\"","\"TtlTradgVol\"","\"TtlTrfVal\"","\"TtlNbOfTxsExctd\"","\"SsnId\"","\"NewBrdLotQty\"","\"Rmks\"","\"Rsvd1\"","\"Rsvd2\"","\"Rsvd3\"","\"Rsvd4\"","\"2026-10-12\"","\"CM\"","\"NSE\"","\"STK\"","\"766540\"","\"ST\"","\"\"","\"R K FASHION ACCESSORIES L\"","\"80.00\"","\"76.00\"","\"82.00\"","\"488000\"","\"39020800.00\"","\"109\"","\"F1\"","\"1600\"","\"2026-10-13\"","\"72.20\"","\"6400\"","\"4\"","\"2026-10-19\"","\"1\"","\"id\"","\"locator\"","\"finding\"","\"consequence\"","\"A01\"","\"S1 pp287-289\"","\"Read complete restatement examination report of Murarka & Associates, dated24 September2026. It says no qualifications requiring restatement adjustments. It explicitly is not a reissued original audit opinion.\"","\"Original statutory reports, CARO and IFC annexures FY24-FY26 were not located in issuer investor index or public primary searches. Original-audit completeness remains ND, not clean assurance.\"","\"A02\"","\"S1 pp292,298,303,309\"","\"CFS FY24 has a 2023 column header despite matching FY24 amounts. FY24 includes merger fixed assets−207.09lakh, merger reserves/P&L19.07lakh, deferred-tax−1.02lakh, share-capital33.35lakh and premium342.65lakh. Notes identify share-exchange amalgamation, not cash financing. FY26 CFS includes6.04lakh capital/premium although note3 describes2223 shares against a604993rupee takeover liability.\"","\"Do not infer these lines are cash inflows/outflows. Preserve reported cash bridges but original bank-level and noncash reconciliation required; cannot safely restate only one leg.\"","\"A03\"","\"S1 pp298,303,309\"","\"Merger shares differ between note3/30 (249128 plus84388) and note59 (270200 plus84377). Official post-IPO issued count is15516763 and controls current valuation.\"","\"Historical merger economics and complete historic diluted-share bridge unresolved; bonus16:1 is not economic dilution.\"","\"A04\"","\"S1 pp299-300,307-310\"","\"Noncurrent investments669.60lakh at June are investment in property. Cash24.95lakh includes15.78lakh cash in hand and9.17lakh bank. Receivables568.43lakh include88.46lakh aged6-12months and13.30lakh aged1-2years; no doubtful allowance. Note51 says receivables/payables/advances subject to confirmation.\"","\"Do not net property against debt or use it for monthly cash rescue. Collection deterioration matters even with unmodified restatement wording.\"","\"A05\"","\"S1 pp304-305,307\"","\"RPT loan from Mohammed Usman rose170.32 to306.40lakh in Q1; interest free. FY26 related MK Jewellers purchases72.06lakh, closing36.88lakh; June purchases9.13lakh, closing29.98lakh. FY24 Shaistah Usman advance314lakh both advanced/repaid. MD Aurangzeb advance5.75lakh in RPT differs from aggregate related-advance1.70lakh at June.\"","\"No diversion proved. Need counterparty-confirmed reconciliation and contractual repayment/standstill terms. Historical gross RPT flows are not annual expense totals.\"","\"A06\"","\"S1 pp307,309 and355-357\"","\"Detailed litigation table at printed357 totals34.19lakh for three tax matters; note33 components32.95+1.23 total34.18lakh, a0.01lakh rounding difference; older summary33.23lakh is stale. No criminal/regulatory promoter/company proceedings disclosed. Note43 says no outstanding loans but note5 and debt chapter show related-party debt.\"","\"Use0.3419crore in linked tax-payment stress. Wording conflicts require reconciliation, not allegation.\"","\"A07\"","\"S1 pp40-43,198-215,333-339\"","\"FY25 top10 customer412.39lakh divided by1777.19lakh equals23.20%, not20.24% printed. Customer tenure narrative4.77years differs table6.6. June segment/channel denominators differ. MD&A June PAT188.86lakh conflicts financial182.86lakh.\"","\"Use financial statements and distinguish inconsistent operating tables; no false precision in organic or concentration scoring.\"","\"A08\"","\"S1 pp293-296,298-314\"","\"All financial notes1-61 and receivable/payable ageing and AS17 segment annexures were reviewed. Indian GAAP AS/DivisionI; no subsidiaries; inventories management-certified; finished goods lower cost/NRV, RM/WIP at cost. No bank facilities, no declared dividends.\"","\"Restated financial extraction is Medium confidence, financial reliability/growth/valuation conclusions Low pending original-audit and scope reconciliation.\"","\"A09\"","\"S1 notes4 and9, printed298 and306\"","\"Note9 states58.58lakh previously uncharged depreciation was adjusted against reserves; note4 records86.09lakh prior-period expense. These are distinct from the examination report statement about audit qualifications.\"","\"Original audits and period-by-period restatement schedules are needed to establish which originating periods bore these charges. No claim of complete clean original-audit reconciliation is made.\"","\"title\"","\"url\"","\"date\"","\"pages\"","\"type\"","\"S1\"","\"R.K. Fashion Accessories RHP\"","\"https://affinityglobalcap.in/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/RHP_LFINAL-1.pdf\"","\"2026-09-29\"","\"9a46095da97b4aea8dc9fe67df2a5923dcbb1968323f32ce2cb609d72b975198\"","\"Printed287-314 financial report and all notes;129-161 objects;39-72 risks;197-227 business;237-282 governance;318-353 MD&A and debt\"","\"Primary issuer offer document hosted by lead manager\"","\"members\"","\"S2\"","\"NSE listing circular CML76831 and post-issue shareholding\"","\"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/content/circulars/CML76831.zip\"","\"2026-10-09\"","\"f732a180d85d4874d3fc9ddb30e91de385db89fe13db8b9d09556d4d6cd8561f\"","\"CML76831.pdf\"","\"SHP_RKFAL.pdf\"","\"9d7dcd30f1bcd50593fc3c3e6fa41565435befdd4f767092c9b736803dd0676a\"","\"a94f6a9c8c8cf3d61ae8bcd82ffaea1c0440ae6bbb198dbbe7c2ad3549ad1a34\"","\"Primary exchange\"","\"S3\"","\"NSE UDiFF market data\"","\"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/content/cm/BhavCopy_NSE_CM_0_0_0_20261019_F_0000.csv.zip\"","\"Primary exchange; hashes and actual URLs pe